# @10k24/p5b

[![npm](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/@10k24/p5b)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@10k24/p5b)

Render p5.js sketches to RGBA pixel buffers in Node.js.

## Installation

```bash
npm install @10k24/p5b
```

